. * Log the imputed series (just merged). NOTE: do NOT re-log meanwks -- Curren
> tData's
. * raw meanwks is empty for the analysis years; the benefit measure here is th
> e
. * pre-built logmeanwks (= log weeks of benefits), which we keep as-is. The di
> ff_*
. * loop below recomputes diff_logmeanwks (the cross-pair benefit difference) f
> rom it.
. foreach y of varlist f x phi thet_corr utilde {
  2.         capture drop log`y'
  3.         gen log`y' = ln(`y')
  4. }
